<title>USA: IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ACTUAL WEDNESDAY 114,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ACTUAL WEDNESDAY 114,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 114,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $0.50-$1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.00 -56.00	   55.00 -56.00</p>
<p>liberal volume	 54.00 -55.00</p>
<p>few			53.50 -54.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to $0.50 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs   42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs-up	     46.00 -49.50	   47.00 -50.50</p>
